        "audioKey": "asset://536c7db5fd59f6fe68510c6531cf3ba196b56aaee96928b65b393eb3dfe7bd2c",
        "body": "This is a short English article used as a layout specimen. It is not a course. Each heading below is a real block the app can paint: prose, a single picture, a gallery, audio, video, a link, a formula plate, and a live graph. Every media locator in this pack is a file under media/.",
